  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> or <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>th</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;option is false.</p>",
